# 🚀 Day 41 – Interactive Learning Studio

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 41** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **📚 Interactive Learning Studio**, a premium interactive learning platform that transforms complex topics into engaging, structured tutorials with hands-on exercises, quizzes, diagrams, and personalized learning experiences.

Unlike traditional online courses, this application teaches one focused topic completely through progressive modules, interactive assessments, and practical challenges—all inside a **single offline HTML application**.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Build a modern learning platform that enables users to master a specific topic through:

- Interactive lessons
- Progressive difficulty
- Visual explanations
- Practical exercises
- Instant quiz feedback
- Final project-based assessment

The focus is on **learning by doing**, not passive reading.

---

